            <title>[IGNITE-3151] Using IgniteCountDownLatch sometimes drives to dead lock.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3151</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Run several serve node (recoment use count of CPU - 1).&lt;br/&gt;
Wait update topology.&lt;br/&gt;
